        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "mode": "prose-faithful",
        "notes": [],
        "english_text": "(Sokkalingam sits beside Sadaiyan. Sadaiyan scoops rice from the plate before him and eats. Kneeling nearby with pots and vessels, Sornam feeds rice to Sokkalingam, who is sitting on Sadaiyan’s lap....)"
      }
    },
